  "summary": "Bring ChatGPT to your desktop with ChatGPT Work and Codex, plus context from your email, screenshots, files, and anything on your screen.",
  "description": "ChatGPT is your everyday AI assistant for Windows. Use Chat to ask questions, explore ideas, write, learn, and work through everyday tasks.\nWhen you need to go further, ChatGPT Work can gather context and turn goals into polished documents, presentations, spreadsheets, reports, analyses, and more—while keeping you in control.\nFor software development, Codex is the coding agent in ChatGPT, built to help you plan, write, review, and ship code.\nBring in context from your apps, files, browser, screenshots, email, and screen so ChatGPT can help without breaking your flow. Whether you're getting a quick answer, finishing a complex project, or building software, ChatGPT brings it together in one desktop app.",
